// CHECK: atomics.pia:69:63: proved: '-' does not overflow u8 [generic]
// CHECK: atomics.pia:69:35: proved: the measure of 'update_from[type#standin#atomic_update#f#type]' decreases [generic]
// CHECK: atomics.pia:12:3: failed: the postcondition holds
// CHECK: atomics.pia:32:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
